block-wrapper invert"><div class="field-block invert"><input class="field-main-contact w-node-_9b63f02c-8bda-0052-8f7c-69171281d1da-8da19975 w-input" maxlength="256" name="firstName" placeholder="First name" type="text" id="First-Name" autocomplete="given-name" required=""/><input class="field-main-contact w-node-_9b63f02c-8bda-0052-8f7c-69171281d1db-8da19975 w-input" maxlength="256" name="lastName" placeholder="Last name" type="text" id="Last-Name" autocomplete="family-name" required=""/></div><div class="field-block invert"><div class="top-text gray">©Email</div><input class="field-main-contact w-node-_9b63f02c-8bda-0052-8f7c-69171281d1df-8da19975 w-input" maxlength="256" name="email" placeholder="Your email" type="email" id="Email" autocomplete="email" required=""/></div><div class="field-block invert"><div class="top-text gray">©Message</div><textarea id="Message" name="message" maxlength="5000" placeholder="How can we help?..." class="field-main-contact large w-node-_9b63f02c-8bda-0052-8f7c-69171281d1e3-8da19975 w-input" required=""></textarea></div><div style="position:absolute; left:-9999px; width:1px; height:1px; overflow:hidden;" aria-hidden="true"><label for="contact-company">Company</label><input type="text" id="contact-company" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div><div class="privacy-space"><p class="p-smaller">*By submitting this form, you agree to be contacted by Circles about your inquiry. We don't share your information with anyone else.</p></div><div class="button-flex"><input type="submit" data-wait="Sending..." class="button w-button" value="Contact Us"/></div></div></form><div id="contact-form-success" class="success-message w-form-done" role="status"><h3>Thank you.</h3><div>Your message is in. We reply to every serious inquiry within one business day.</div></div><div id="contact-form-error" class="error-message w-form-fail" role="alert"><div>Something went wrong on our end. Please try again, or email us directly at hello@circlescr.com.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="divider-l"></div><div class="faq-grid"><div><div><h2 class="page-title">FAQ© — Questions, resolved. <span class="gray-color">Insight, structure, and execution aligned from the start.</span></h2><div class="divider-l"></div><div class="button-flex"><a href="mailto:hello@circlescr.com" data-wf--button-line--variant="base" data-wf-component-id="64524c8d-f2ce-d90a-bb23-2f13e9a4e1bb" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="button-link w-inline-block"><div class="button-flex"><div class="text-overflow"><div class="navigation-text-main _01">Email us</div><div class="navigation-text-main _02">Email us</div></div><div class="line-divider"><div class="line-absolute"></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div><div><div class="toggle-wrapper"><a href="#" class="toggle-header w-inline-block"><div class="toggle-top"><div>What does Circles actually build?</div></div><div class="toogle-icon"><div class="line-1"></div><div class="line-2"></div></div></a><div class="toggle-content"><div class="toggle-space"><p class="paragraph">Four connected practices: AI agents and automation, product and ecommerce engineering, brand strategy and identity, and performance marketing. Most engagements combine two or three of these: an AI support agent wired into a new storefront, or a rebrand that ships alongside the site that carries it.</p></div></div></div><div class="toggle-wrapper"><a href="#" class="toggle-header w-inline-block"><div class="toggle-top"><div>Do we need an AI strategy, or just an AI feature?</div></div><div class="toogle-icon"><div class="line-1"></div><div class="line-2"></div></div></a><div class="toggle-content"><div class="toggle-space"><p class="paragraph">Usually neither, at first. We start with an audit of where manual work is actually costing you time or money, then recommend the smallest system that solves it, sometimes a single automation, sometimes a full agent. We'd rather ship something narrow that works than something broad that doesn't.</p></div></div></div><div class="toggle-wrapper"><a href="#" class="toggle-header w-inline-block"><div class="toggle-top"><div>How do you scope a new engagement?</div></div><div class="toogle-icon"><div class="line-1"></div><div class="line-2"></div></div></a><div class="toggle-content"><div class="toggle-space"><p class="paragraph">Every project starts with a discovery call, followed by a short written scope: goals, timeline, and what "done" looks like in measurable terms. You approve that before any design or build work starts, so there are no surprises once the invoice arrives.</p></div></div></div><div class="toggle-wrapper"><a href="#" class="toggle-header w-inline-block"><div class="toggle-top"><div>How long does a typical project take?</div></div><div class="toogle-icon"><div class="line-1"></div><div class="line-2"></div></div></a><div class="toggle-content"><div class="toggle-space"><p class="paragraph">A brand or web engagement typically runs 4–8 weeks. AI automation projects range from a two-week single workflow to a multi-month agent build. Performance marketing and ongoing product work are retainer-based, with monthly reporting built in from day one.</p></div></div></div><div class="toggle-wrapper"><a href="#" class="toggle-header w-inline-block"><div class="toggle-top"><div>Do you work with teams outside Costa Rica?</div></div><div class="toogle-icon"><div class="line-1"></div><div class="line-2"></div></div></a><div class="toggle-content"><div class="toggle-space"><p class="paragraph">Most of our engagements are remote-first. We're based in Pérez Zeledón, and we work with teams across North America and Latin America on the same time-zone-friendly schedule. If it helps to talk it through first, a call costs nothing.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div data-w-id="6637c249-41f9-c402-ef4e-dbcfc5776f63"></div><div class="footer"><div class="container"><div class="align-center"><h2 class="h2 fade cnt sml inv